{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "徹庸和尚谷響集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱珙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "咄！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱允禮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諱志孟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "噫！"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "并敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上堂祝國經咒儀文還依舊本，下堂禱聖祝白，因本山學人所習不一，或增或減，不無欣厭之\n嘆，故新更數詞，以教家門，非意流傳也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或誦咒、或念誥，其最後一句宜高舉，使音韻相接，此中不用稱號"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "座下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "座下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "座下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文長者謂幽魂獨識非誡，以淺近俗白之言，恐彼未易曉了，故不用短句隱辭，\n讀者勿生厭云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "囑孤魂，須主意重在孤魂上，鬼王乃觀音大士，不待有祝而度生也，其後隨稱救苦觀世音菩薩\n或地藏菩薩，不必念「願往生脫苦輪」等俗語，不惟本無出處，且不當其位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "座下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在祖師、聖僧則稱祈禱；韋陀、伽藍、監齋、龍王可稱仰祝；至於孤魂則曰謹囑。故祝與囑不同，雖皆一\n寺之當位，然不無優劣。而于觀音至聖，不宜妄加言以祝之，若可祝則\n三世諸佛亦應祝也，且禱與祝、白與囑，不可一概無分云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T01n0007_p0201a16"}
